{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01168","headline":"相和歌辞 从军行 · 刘希夷","name":"相和歌辞 从军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋来风瑟瑟，羣马胡行疾。\n严城昼不开，伏兵暗相失。\n天子庙堂拜，将军玉门出。\n纷纷伊洛间，戎马数千匹。\n军门压黄河，兵气冲白日。\n平生怀伏劒，忼慨既投笔。\n南登汉月孤，北走燕云密。\n近取韩彭计，早知孙吴术。\n丈夫清万里，谁能埽一室。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}